Yeah, when you don't
understand an error message.

00:03:58.020 --> 00:03:59.050
So you're compiling something.

00:03:59.050 --> 00:03:59.890
You're running a command.

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:02.650
It doesn't really quite work and
