00:57:11.200 --> 00:57:14.200
to kind of peek ahead and not
actually move-- not that far.

00:57:14.200 --> 00:57:15.180
Just to 22.

00:57:15.180 --> 00:57:19.250
Peek ahead at 22 and realize,
