00:57:58.614 --> 00:57:59.113
OK.

00:57:59.113 --> 00:58:00.060
Now what happens next?

00:58:00.060 --> 00:58:00.726
That's step one.

00:58:00.726 --> 00:58:01.882
ANDREA: Now I can point.

00:58:01.882 --> 00:58:03.590
DAVID J. MALAN: Now
