01:12:52.320 --> 01:12:53.640
AUDIENCE: [INAUDIBLE].

01:12:53.640 --> 01:12:54.240
DAVID J. MALAN: Just one.

01:12:54.240 --> 01:12:54.740
Right.

01:12:54.740 --> 01:12:57.570
Because literally, we've only
