01:31:30.250 --> 01:31:31.030
over.

01:31:31.030 --> 01:31:32.630
So what is this?

01:31:32.630 --> 01:31:35.620
This is the only real
new notation today,

01:31:35.620 --> 01:31:38.180
even though we're using
